# Ports - Mac Studio Service Mapping

**Last updated:** 2026-02-28 23:51 EST

**Network:**
- **Local:** `localhost`
- **Tailscale:** `studio.adal-rigel.ts.net`

**NAS services:** All accessible via `media.adal-rigel.ts.net` (automatic Tailscale exposure)

---

## Mac Studio Services

| Service | Port | Local URL | Tailscale URL |
|---------|------|-----------|---------------|
| **OpenClaw Control UI** | 18789 | http://localhost:18789 | https://studio.adal-rigel.ts.net |
| **Kavita** | 5007 | http://localhost:5007 | http://studio.adal-rigel.ts.net:5007 |
| **Komga** | 5008 | http://localhost:5008 | http://studio.adal-rigel.ts.net:5008 |
| **SearXNG** | 8889 | http://localhost:8889 | http://studio.adal-rigel.ts.net:8889 |
| **OpenProject** | 8087 | http://localhost:8087 | http://studio.adal-rigel.ts.net:8087 |

**Note:** OpenClaw served as HTTPS root (no port in Tailscale URL)

---

## Tailscale Serve Configuration

**Current config:**
```
https://studio.adal-rigel.ts.net → http://localhost:18789 (OpenClaw)
http://studio.adal-rigel.ts.net:5007 → http://localhost:5007 (Kavita)
http://studio.adal-rigel.ts.net:8087 → http://localhost:8087 (OpenProject)
```

**Check what's served:**
```bash
tailscale serve status
```

**Expose new service:**
```bash
# As HTTPS root (no port)
tailscale serve https:443 http://localhost:PORT

# As specific port
tailscale serve http:PORT http://localhost:PORT

# Remove exposure
tailscale serve reset
```

---

## Common Tasks

### Check if service is running
```bash
docker ps | grep <service-name>
```

### Test connectivity
```bash
# Local
curl -I http://localhost:<PORT>

# Tailscale
curl -I http://studio.adal-rigel.ts.net:<PORT>
```

### Restart service
```bash
docker restart <container-name>
```

---

## Port Conflicts

**To avoid:** Check this file before assigning new ports.

